{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1390,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A little while ago I was forwarded an email\nwith a video of spectacular fireworks in front"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5620,
    "dDurationMs": 1179,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of Mount Fuji."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6799,
    "dDurationMs": 4141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The original email said that the fireworks\nhad been intended for the 2020 Olympics opening"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10940,
    "dDurationMs": 4270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ceremony that had been canceled due to the\npandemic and so Japan decided to share them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15210,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16210,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It’s such a great story, and they really\nare impressive fireworks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19150,
    "dDurationMs": 3179,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that might have been the end of it…\nexcept, something felt off to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22329,
    "dDurationMs": 3561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually, a number of things felt off to me,\nand that’s what gave me pause."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25890,
    "dDurationMs": 2459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which is the point of this whole video: Pause."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28349,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Verb."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29349,
    "dDurationMs": 4341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "“To stop temporarily… for the purpose\nof deliberation, or on account of doubt or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33690,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "uncertainty.”"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34710,
    "dDurationMs": 6029,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think that in our super-connected, internet-fueled\nworld, the art of the pause is of utmost importance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40739,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what gave me pause with that fireworks\nvideo?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43239,
    "dDurationMs": 3791,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, first, it was forwarded to me in an\nemail that had clearly already been forwarded"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47030,
    "dDurationMs": 5299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "multiple times and had no clear original source,\nno record of who or when it came from."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52329,
    "dDurationMs": 3971,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I remembered that the olympics and\nmost live stuff on TV usually has those little"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56300,
    "dDurationMs": 3650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "watermarks showing it’s the olympics or\nsaying what network you’re watching - and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59950,
    "dDurationMs": 1413,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this video didn’t and again there was no\nrecord of who or where it came from, when"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61363,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there SHOULD have been."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62363,
    "dDurationMs": 2827,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I noticed the music in the video\nis the well-known and very European William"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65190,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tell Overture… which would be an unusual\nchoice for Japan, as olympic host countries"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69330,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "typically like to feature their own cultural\nheritage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72130,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I realized that this fireworks display\nwouldn’t actually work very well from a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75750,
    "dDurationMs": 4070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stadium, where olympics opening ceremonies\n(and their fireworks) tend to be held."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79820,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I realized there are firework designs\nand colors in there that I’ve never ever"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83480,
    "dDurationMs": 1150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "seen in real life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84630,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there doesn’t seem to be any smoke?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86990,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And finally, this is exactly the kind of feel-good\nstory that pulls at your heartstrings (and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91950,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that marketers and influencers know pulls\nat your heartstrings)."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95200,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don’t know which of these things first\ngave me pause (though I suspect it was because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98320,
    "dDurationMs": 2339,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was a multiple-times-forwarded email of\nunknown origin), but once I paused, the observations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100659,
    "dDurationMs": 1941,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all came spilling out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102600,
    "dDurationMs": 5089,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are four pieces to a good pause: First,\nnoticing the impulse to pause - it will be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107689,
    "dDurationMs": 4741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "weak, and faint, just a niggling doubt or\na tentative question at the back of your mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112430,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Notice it!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113430,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Second, heeding that urge, and actually pausing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116160,
    "dDurationMs": 4430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before you react, whether in delight, or anger,\nor simply passing by and going on with your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120590,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "life (which is itself a reaction) - pause."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122450,
    "dDurationMs": 1790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to give yourself a moment to think."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124240,
    "dDurationMs": 5050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Third is the pause itself - the “deliberation\non account of doubt or uncertainty”."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129290,
    "dDurationMs": 4250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This part can be short, or long - that’s\nup to you, and to the reason for your pause,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133540,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "though you probably don’t want it to be\ntoo long."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135290,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the case of the fireworks, it took me a\nsingle google search of “Japan Mt Fuji Fireworks”"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140390,
    "dDurationMs": 3730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to bring up an associated press article about\nhow the fireworks were confirmed to be a computer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144120,
    "dDurationMs": 1130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "simulation by a representative of the company\nthat made the simulation software, and how"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145250,
    "dDurationMs": 3230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the video was originally posted to youtube\nas early as 2015."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148480,
    "dDurationMs": 3883,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your pause, your deliberation, might take\nless time, or more What evidence is needed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152363,
    "dDurationMs": 2037,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to assess the claim?, or you might decide\nyou don’t care enough to deliberate and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154400,
    "dDurationMs": 1430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you just want to get on with your life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155830,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which brings us to Fourth: What happens after\nthe pause."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159390,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What you do with the results of your deliberation\n(whatever they are)."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163519,
    "dDurationMs": 2931,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe instead of speaking out in anger you\nremain quiet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166450,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe instead of going quietly on with your\nlife you get righteously angry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170470,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe you remain just as delighted as before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172730,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here are two recent lighthearted moments where\nI paused:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175200,
    "dDurationMs": 3959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First: an article mentioned in passing that\nsoap operas are called that because they were"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179159,
    "dDurationMs": 2691,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "originally sponsored by soap manufacturers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181850,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which sounds too good to be true, so I paused."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184650,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But quick searches of a number of reliable\nsources confirm it IS true and intimately"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188160,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "connected with the origins of modern American-style\nmarketing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189160,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I’ll pass along the factoid to you!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190520,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The “Soap” in “soap opera” does, in\nfact, refer to soap."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194720,
    "dDurationMs": 4610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My second pause: a tweet about how the ingredient\n“eye of newt” (famously used as a witchcraft"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199330,
    "dDurationMs": 4250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ingredient in Shakespeare’s Macbeth) was\nactually just a code name for a common kitchen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203580,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "spice which I’m not going to share here\nbecause… you’ll see why."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204580,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I thought “wow, that’s so cool, I never\nknew that” and then immediately… “it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207590,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sounds too perfect…” and “wait, this\nwebsite looks a bit weird…”"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210730,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I paused."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211730,
    "dDurationMs": 3319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then spent five hours trying to find original\nsources to confirm or deny the quoted fact."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215049,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I couldn’t find any - I mean, I did\nfind some awesome sixteenth century herbalist"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218909,
    "dDurationMs": 2901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "books that tell you about all the ailments\nyou can cure with cabbage good for they that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221810,
    "dDurationMs": 1610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "see not well, and for the trembling of the\nmembers, and lots of plants are named for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223420,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "resemblances to animals, but the articles\nand blog posts I found that claim that ‘“eye"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227400,
    "dDurationMs": 5030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of newt” is a code word’ are mostly personal\nblogs (rather than established, reputable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232430,
    "dDurationMs": 4339,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "institutions), and none of them cited any\nsources for their claims except (if anything)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236769,
    "dDurationMs": 1190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "other internet blogs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237959,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, they all seem to share a similar\nlist of “secret witchcraft code words”"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242579,
    "dDurationMs": 1371,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "copied over and over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243950,
    "dDurationMs": 4179,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It’s possible their lists are similar because\nthey’re based in truth, or maybe parts are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248129,
    "dDurationMs": 1841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "correct and parts aren’t."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249970,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or maybe it’s all made up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250970,
    "dDurationMs": 1370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I couldn’t figure it out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252340,
    "dDurationMs": 3890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you have a primary source that confirms\n“eye of newt” was (or wasn’t) a code"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256230,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "word for mustard seed, please let me know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259190,
    "dDurationMs": 3310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is all a bit carefree, but I’m sure\nyou can think of plenty of more serious and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262500,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "consequential claims being made online."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266550,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And because they pull at our heartstrings\nor stoke our anger, it’s easy to believe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270000,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "them and act based on them, because we WANT\nto."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272510,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, the examples in this video were all\nshared with me by very smart, thoughtful people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276910,
    "dDurationMs": 3910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The person who sent me the fireworks email,\nI know, was sending it to brighten my day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280820,
    "dDurationMs": 5070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the point of the pause is not to be a\nbuzzkill or a “well actually”, but rather,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285890,
    "dDurationMs": 4210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to allow ourselves not to get caught up in\nmanufactured or manipulative buzz and spread"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290100,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291100,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To give ourselves a moment before we jump\ninto action - to make sure it’s the action"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294000,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we actually want to take."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295690,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The pause is a superpower of modern life - it’s\nthe second chance, the extra life, the opportunity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301850,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to act not reflexively on first impressions,\nbut thoughtfully upon something closer to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305520,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the truth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306520,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It gives you a moment when you get to decide\nwhich alternate history of the universe you’d"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309360,
    "dDurationMs": 4730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like to be in: the one where you react like\nyou’d been about to before you paused, or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314090,
    "dDurationMs": 1850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where you react differently."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315940,
    "dDurationMs": 3230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh yeah - and you don’t want to be pausing\nall the time, and questioning EVERYTHING you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319170,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hear in the world around you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320700,
    "dDurationMs": 2090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That would be exhausting and impossible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322790,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But your pause-detector can be quietly on\nin the background a lot of the time without"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326420,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "affecting your daily life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328220,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here are some tips for things that set off\nmy pause-detector:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332120,
    "dDurationMs": 3590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it a forwarded email with the original\nsenders removed, or a screenshot with the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335710,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "source removed, or a social media post with\nno original source, or really anything that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340090,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has an unclear source?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341800,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or: is it too good to be true?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344060,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does it pull at my heartstrings?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345890,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does it make me super angry?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347730,
    "dDurationMs": 3110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does it try to convince me to NOT be angry,\nand to be complacent?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350840,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it something that supports my worldview\nbut comes from an unknown or unvetted source?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354820,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it a really cool super awesome incredible\nunbelievable story?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358680,
    "dDurationMs": 1270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pause."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359950,
    "dDurationMs": 5370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In particular I pause - even just briefly\n- if something is emotionally powerful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365320,
    "dDurationMs": 4090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Marketers and propagandists know that inciting\nemotions is a powerful tool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369410,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so do good storytellers, and good leaders!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372180,
    "dDurationMs": 4570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Inspiring an emotional response isn’t intrinsically\ngood or bad, but if I notice someone or something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376750,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is getting me to react emotionally, I take\na moment to pause - and decide if I want to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381750,
    "dDurationMs": 4490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "continue allowing that emotional inspiration\ninto my life, or not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386240,
    "dDurationMs": 5891,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ok, so we’ve got a sponsor that’s a REALLY\ngood match for this video: GiveWell, the non-profit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392131,
    "dDurationMs": 2639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that researches \u0026 vets other charities for\nyou."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394770,
    "dDurationMs": 3832,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In particular, GiveWell searches out the non-profits\nthat immediately and directly benefit or save"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398602,
    "dDurationMs": 4218,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the most peoples' lives for the least money,\nlike health \u0026 economic programs in developing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402820,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "countries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403820,
    "dDurationMs": 2710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can look at GiveWell’s full charity\nrecommendation list on their website, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406530,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can also give directly to those charities\n(or to a fund directed to the current top"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410220,
    "dDurationMs": 3910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "choices) through GiveWell; 100% of your donation\ngoes to the charities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414130,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On top of that, Givewell is matching donations\nfrom first time donors dollar for dollar up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418130,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to 250 dollars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419470,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Click on the link in the description to donate\nand be sure to use fundraiser code minutephysics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423330,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at checkout to make sure your donation gets\nmatched."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425660,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Again, that’s fundraiser code minutephysics\nand your donation to GiveWell recommended"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429040,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "charities will get matched up to 250 dollars."
    } ]
  } ]
}
